title: Payers › Add a payer
route: /payers
intro: The 'Add a payer' modal. A new payer gets a full starter set (workflow, rules and document lists) and benchmark figures; the agents learn the rest from decisions. Nothing is saved until 'Add payer' passes its four checks, and a name that another payer already has is refused. The new payer is also offered wherever New case picks a payer.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Add a payer'\ntop right of Payers"
overlay m "Add a payer\nThe agents start with a standard workflow\nand learn the rest from decisions."

group gF "Fields in the modal"
  input i1 "Type 'Payer name' (required)\nExample: Riverbend Health"
  input i2 "Pick 'Plan type'\nManaged care plan, PPO,\nMedicare Advantage, Carve-out"
  input i3 "Pick 'Group'\nOhio Medicaid, Commercial,\nMedicare Advantage, Behavioral carve-out"
  input i4 "Tick 'How it is reached'\nPortal (ticked), Phone, Fax"
  input i5 "Tick 'Programs it covers'\nResidential 3.5, IOP, PHP ticked\nDetox not ticked"
endgroup

process clr "Typing or ticking clears any red message"
click ca "Click 'Add payer'"
decision v1 "Is the payer name empty?"
decision v1b "Does the name match another payer?\nAny capitals, extra spaces ignored.\nA short name counts: 'Cardinal', 'Beacon'"
decision v2 "Is no way of reaching ticked?"
decision v3 "Is no program ticked?"
toast e1 "Under the name box:\n'Add the payer's name.'"
toast e1b "Under the name box:\n'There is already a payer called\nBeacon PPO. Use a different name.'"
toast e2 "Choose at least one way to reach the payer."
toast e3 "Choose at least one program."

store st "Payer saved with a full starter set\nWorkflow v1 (six steps for how it is reached)\nFour rules, document lists for all four levels of care\nFigures marked as benchmark estimates"
process rb "'Reached by' is written in a fixed order\nPortal, phone, fax: 'Portal, phone and fax'\nso it is always one of the seven listed values"
store lg "Edit log gets 'Added a payer'\nReason 'Payer added'"
toast tt "'Riverbend Health was added'\nStarter workflow, rules and documents are ready.\nFigures are benchmark estimates."
process nav "Modal closes\nOpens /payers/custom-riverbend-health?tab=process"
screen pg "New payer's Process tab\nTitle now counts 7 payers\nRow in its group, green dot\nHeader: 'Not enough' for both figures"
process other "The payer is also saved where other screens read it\nNew case offers it wherever a payer is picked,\nand reads its document list and rules like any payer"

click cx "Click 'Cancel'"
click cesc "Press Escape, click the X\nor click the dimmed area\nEscape with a menu open closes the menu first"
endx x1 "Modal closes\nNothing was added"
end e "New payer is ready to edit"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Process › Read the workflow"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Medical records › Patient and insurance rows"

s1 --> m --> i1 --> i2 --> i3 --> i4 --> i5 --> ca
i1 -.-> clr
i4 -.-> clr
ca --> v1
v1 -->|Yes| e1 --> i1
v1 -->|No| v1b
v1b -->|Yes| e1b --> i1
v1b -->|No| v2
v2 -->|Yes| e2 --> i4
v2 -->|No| v3
v3 -->|Yes| e3 --> i5
v3 -->|No| st --> rb --> lg --> tt --> nav --> pg --> g1
st -.-> other
other -.-> g2
pg --> e
m --> cx --> x1
m --> cesc --> x1
